  {
   "i": 40,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "2. Scope"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "This notice covers personal data we process through the tagra.app website: the free-trial enquiry form, optional analytics, and the technical operation of the site. It does not cover third-party websites we link to (for example tdt.cz, EUR-Lex or social platforms), which have their own privacy notices."
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "3. What we collect, why, and on what legal basis"
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Data"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Purpose"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Legal basis (GDPR Art. 6)"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Name and e-mail address you submit in the trial form"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "To send you the trial download link and to respond to your enquiry about TAGRA"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Steps taken at your request prior to a contract, and your consent — Art. 6(1)(b)/(a)"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Usage statistics via analytics cookies (Google Analytics 4, Microsoft Clarity)"
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "To understand how the site is used and improve it"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Your consent — Art. 6(1)(a). Off by default; loaded only after you click “Accept”."
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Server and security logs (IP address, request data) collected by our hosting provider"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "To operate the site, ensure security and prevent abuse"
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Our legitimate interest — Art. 6(1)(f)"
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "E-mail correspondence you send us"
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "To handle your request"
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Legitimate interest / pre-contractual steps"
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "4. Cookies and similar technologies"
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "The site sets"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "no analytics cookies until you give consent"
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "via our cookie banner. We use Google Consent Mode v2, which keeps analytics storage denied by default. Only strictly necessary technologies (and your saved cookie choice) are used without consent."
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Name / store"
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Set by"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Purpose"
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "k": "text",
   "en": "Loaded"
  },
